<header class="forge-workspace-navigation">
  <div class="forge-workspace-titlebar">
    <h1>{{#if isActorWorkspace}}生物工作台{{else}}物品工作台{{/if}}</h1>
    <div class="forge-workspace-tools">
      <span data-workspace-connection-summary role="status" aria-live="polite">读取 AI 连接状态…</span>
      {{#if isActorWorkspace}}<button type="button" data-workspace-encounter><i class="fas fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i> 生物与召唤物</button>{{/if}}
      <button type="button" data-workspace-connection><i class="fas fa-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i> AI 连接设置</button>
      <button type="button" data-workspace-guide><i class="fas fa-book-open" aria-hidden="true"></i> 图解手册</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="forge-workspace-navigation-row">
    <div class="forge-workspace-modes" role="group" aria-label="资料输入方式">
      {{#if isActorWorkspace}}<button type="button" data-forge-mode="blueprint" aria-pressed="false">手工蓝图</button>{{/if}}
      <button type="button" data-forge-mode="structured" aria-pressed="false">标准资料</button>
      <button type="button" data-forge-mode="ai" aria-pressed="false">AI 整理</button>
    </div>
    <ol class="forge-workspace-progress" aria-label="当前进度">
      <li data-workspace-stage="input">输入</li><li data-workspace-stage="review">审核</li><li data-workspace-stage="created">完成</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <p class="forge-workspace-mode-note"><i class="fas fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>各输入方式保留自己的草稿。切换后需重新生成或审核，复杂资料不会自动改成蓝图。</span></p>
</header>
